      "subject": "server",
      "stage": "mqtt_fsm",
      "description": "In this case, if a CONNECT packet is received with Clean Start set to 0, and there is a Session associated with the Client Identifier, the Broker MUST resume communications with the Client based on the state from the existing Session.",
